fs-formula-combat-stim = Combat Stim
fs-formula-combat-stim-purpose = Crew in the cloud get +15% damage, +30% swing speed, +20% fire rate and +15% movement for 20 seconds. Standing in it keeps it topped up.

fs-formula-mending-mist = Mending Mist
fs-formula-mending-mist-purpose = Stops bleeding and heals crew a little every half second they stand in it.

fs-formula-corrosive = Corrosive
fs-formula-corrosive-purpose = Burns every zombie in the cloud. The damage and the kills are yours.

fs-formula-weakening = Weakening Agent
fs-formula-weakening-purpose = Zombies caught in it take 25% more damage from every source for 8 seconds after they leave.

fs-formula-solvent = Solvent
fs-formula-solvent-purpose = Strips the plating off armoured zombies for good, so every shot after lands in full.

fs-formula-etchant = Etchant
fs-formula-etchant-purpose = Crew in the cloud fire armour-piercing shots for 20 seconds.

fs-formula-adrenal-surge = Adrenal Surge
fs-formula-adrenal-surge-purpose = Crew in the cloud move 15% faster and shrug off hits that would interrupt healing or surgery, for 20 seconds.

fs-formula-battle-analgesic = Battle Analgesic
fs-formula-battle-analgesic-purpose = Crew in the cloud drag casualties 40% faster and treat wounds 15% faster for 20 seconds. Throw it on the medics.

fs-formula-binding-agent = Binding Agent
fs-formula-binding-agent-purpose = Zombies wading through it move 40% slower.

fs-chem-launcher-no-formula = No formula loaded. Set one at the field kit station.
fs-chem-launcher-dry = Reserve too low. Stay near the fighting to refill it.
fs-chem-launcher-none = You need a chem launcher in your hands or kit.

